===Generation III===
In {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}, the group is known as '''Kanto Rider Federation''' (Japanese: '''カントーれんごう''' ''Kanto Federation''). They are formed by eight members, here called Goons, and their boss, who are found trying to take over {{OBP|Three Island|town}}, terrorizing its citizens. To fight them, the {{player}} must first go to [[Joyful Game Corner]], where one of the members will show up looking for his teammates.

