===Generation IV===
The Kanto Pokémon Federation is present in {{game|HeartGold and SoulSilver|s}} and plays the same role from [[Generation II]], but using Pokémon in higher [[level]]s and rewarding lower prizes. Their overworld sprites don't differ anymore.

