==In the manga==
===Pokémon Adventures===
The Kanto Federation appeared in ''[[PS275|A Vicious Cycle of Possibilities]]''. Having arrived at Three Island, they were attempting to vandalize [[Berry Forest]]. On their way, they found [[Lostelle]], who was looking for her {{p|Dunsparce}}. Their boss threatened the little girl, grabbing her by the shirt. At that moment, {{adv|Deoxys}} appeared and smashed the group and their motorbikes. Their boss then heard someone stepping by and asked for help, but {{adv|Giovanni|the man}} instead hit him back, disgusted by how little effort the bikers were putting into being evil.

